column67:
Definitely agree with need for iteration syntax and yieldfrom keyword. The iteration syntax will probably have be something different than &quot;for a in b&quot; because that&#x27;s already used for array-like iteration and adding another case would slow existing code down (all of which wouldn&#x27;t be using it of course). For yieldfrom the code it needs to generate is something like this:<p><pre><code>    var generator = g1(), result = {}, send;
    while(!result.done) {
        result = generator.send(send);
        send = yield result.value;
    }</code></pre>
